    "message": "We recognize the current military balance favors Cestria. Our reinforcements arrive in Period 2, shifting the odds to 80% for Borvane. To avoid costly war now, we propose you offer a favorable division. If the division is insufficient, we will be compelled to strike in Period 2 for a better outcome. We prefer a peaceful settlement now that acknowledges the impending shift."
}

{
    "message": "Our intention is to avoid unnecessary conflict. We acknowledge the current military balance and the coming shift. We propose a settlement that recognizes both sides' interests. We urge Ostrelia to consider a division that reflects the future reality, as honoring any agreement will be influenced by the changing strategic calculus. We are prepared to negotiate sincerely."
}

{
    "message": "Jorvania is committed to resolving this crisis peacefully and securing fair terms for both nations. We propose lifting the blockade immediately in exchange for a negotiated division of the valley access that reflects the current military balance. We are prepared to discuss terms but will not accept an unfair distribution that disadvantages Jorvania."
}
